@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### List demo tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a ticket
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "ticketNo": "TK-LOCAL-001",
  "businessNo": "O202607060001",
  "channel": "WEB",
  "description": "客户已支付成功，但订单仍显示待支付。",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}
